# 詞: 睇怕

1. 佢睇怕我哋，覺得我哋好弱。 (He looks down on us and thinks we are weak.)
2. 唔好睇怕新手，佢哋都有學習嘅機會。 (Don't look down on beginners; they also have the chance to learn.)
3. 佢睇怕我哋嘅意見，覺得自己最叻。 (He looks down on our opinions and thinks he is the best.)
4. 我哋唔應該睇怕其他人，要尊重每個人。 (We should not look down on others; we must respect everyone.)
5. 佢睇怕我哋嘅努力，覺得我哋做唔到。 (He looks down on our efforts and thinks we can't do it.)
6. 唔好睇怕失敗，失敗係學習嘅一部分。 (Don't look down on failure; failure is part of learning.)
7. 佢睇怕我哋嘅選擇，覺得我哋唔聰明。 (He looks down on our choices and thinks we are not smart.)
8. 我哋應該互相支持，唔好睇怕對方。 (We should support each other and not look down on each other.)
9. 佢睇怕我哋嘅背景，覺得我哋唔夠資格。 (He looks down on our background and thinks we are not qualified.)
10. 唔好睇怕挑戰，挑戰可以幫我哋成長。 (Don't look down on challenges; challenges can help us grow.) [end of text]


